menu "Font Partition Configuration"
    config FONT_PARTITION_REQUIRED
        bool "Font partition required"
        default y
        help
            Font partition component requires a partition table with sufficient space.
            The GBK font data requires approximately 1.2MB of flash space.
            Make sure the app partition is at least 2MB to accommodate the font data.

            Recommended partition table configuration:
            - Single app large partition (2MB+)
            - Or custom partition table with factory partition >= 2MB

    config FONT_PARTITION_SIZE_MIN
        int "Minimum partition size for fonts (KB)"
        default 2048
        depends on FONT_PARTITION_REQUIRED
        help
            Minimum size in KB for the app partition when using fonts component.
            GBK font data requires approximately 1200KB, so 2048KB (2MB) is recommended.

endmenu
